# Profile

Software automation tester with 5+ years of experience across testing, automation and QA, certified in ISTQB and AZ-900. Solid skills in automated and manual testing of web applications: UI and API test automation, exposure to performance and unit testing.

Most recently at Intellihub: designed BDD test automation across Python and TypeScript frameworks and led AI enablement, from agentic engineering design patterns to shared Copilot Skills, an AI-powered PR review agent and monthly knowledge-sharing sessions.

